        "created_at": "2013-04-03T19:56:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, sux. &nbsp;Legacy will almost never benefit from his own Galvanization because it gets turned on in the Power phase (after he's played any one-shots) and turned off in the Start phase (before he plays any one-shots or powers).</p>",
