      {
        "id": 57419,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-05T21:39:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Actually, playing Galvanise out of turn wouldn't help - you'd have to Galvanise on your turn and take advantage of it (by deailng damage) out of turn - Galvanise runs out at the start of Legacy's turn so if he buffed himself with it on someone else's turn, it would still disappear at the start of his own. On the other hand, he can Galvanise on his turn, then Galvanise out of turn (eg via the Adept) to stack the buff twice, giving everyone else +2 to damage for the duration :).</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:32:44.876Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
